'''Minty''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2019 Christmas Box|Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2019|2019 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Minty’s upper barrel, cylinder, and handle all use a red and white candy cane design. Its cylinder frame and trigger frame use a gingerbread brown color, and the under barrel, cylinder frame designs, and trigger all use a golden coloring. Attached to the back of the cylinder where the hammer would be is a holly. 

==Trivia==
*It partners with the [[Ancient Weapons|ancient]] knife [[Logchopper]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Logchopper Set|Logchopper Set]].
*Minty is the 3rd candy cane themed godly to ever be released to the game. The others being [[Sugar]], [[Candy]], [[Eternalcane]], [[Lugercane]] and [[Peppermint]].
*It was one of the four [[Godly Weapons|godly]] weapons released during the [[Christmas Event 2019]], the others being [[Frostbite]], [[Lugercane]] and [[Eternalcane]].
*There are [[Blue Minty|blue]], [[Bronze Minty|bronze]], [[Silver Minty|silver]], and [[Gold Minty|gold]] reskin variants of this gun, which were released as [[Unique Weapons|unique]] trophies.

